+%   See https://matpower.org for more info.
+
+%     properties
+%     end     %% properties
+
+    methods
+        %% constructor
+        function obj = data_model_cpf()
+            % Constructor, assign default data model element classes.
+            %
+            % Create an empty data model object and assign the default
