+classdef (Abstract) nme_shunt_ac < mp.nme_shunt% & mp.form_ac
+% mp.nme_shunt_ac - Network model element abstract base class for shunt for AC formulations.
+%
+% Builds the parameter :math:`\YY`.
+
+%   MATPOWER
