+function t_mpxt_legacy_dcline(quiet)
+% t_mpxt_legacy_dcline - Tests for legacy DC line extension in mp.xt_legacy_dcline.
+
+%   MATPOWER
+%   Copyright (c) 2011-2024, Power Systems Engineering Research Center (PSERC)
