+function t_opf_tspopf_scpdipm(quiet)
+% t_opf_tspopf_scpdipm - Tests for legacy SCPDIPM-based optimal power flow.
+
+%   MATPOWER
+%   Copyright (c) 2004-2024, Power Systems Engineering Research Center (PSERC)
