+function t_opf_tspopf_tralm(quiet)
+% t_opf_tspopf_tralm - Tests for legacy TRALM-based optimal power flow.
+
+%   MATPOWER
+%   Copyright (c) 2004-2024, Power Systems Engineering Research Center (PSERC)
+%   by Ray Zimmerman, PSERC Cornell
+%
